{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your neighbor has insulted your lawn! It's time to show him that your lawn is the best on the block!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Extremely satisfying &amp; chill gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451380/extras/a0ca0702d8abe4afede38b1352e47ab2.poster.avif?t=1753627110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451380/extras/a0ca0702d8abe4afede38b1352e47ab2.webm?t=1753627110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451380/extras/a0ca0702d8abe4afede38b1352e47ab2.mp4?t=1753627110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cut grass, buy upgrades, and collect<i> all</i>\u00a0the things to become a grass cutting legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use various tools and weapons to cut grass in a very satisfying way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase upgrades to increase the quality and quantity of your grass.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Harvest crops for passive income and try to collect each of the rare <i>Golden Crops</i>!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451380/extras/860ef3175e81b5d76c30f5cd5d6efe97.poster.avif?t=1753627110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451380/extras/860ef3175e81b5d76c30f5cd5d6efe97.webm?t=1753627110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451380/extras/860ef3175e81b5d76c30f5cd5d6efe97.mp4?t=1753627110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prestige to unlock new abilities that allow you to make more cash more quickly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chill with idle mode or play actively for increased gains - you can't go wrong!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experience all-encompassing extremely satisfying grass-cutting nirvana now!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451380/extras/1ba36bc5fe4fbe33caba49acdb166b90.poster.avif?t=1753627110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451380/extras/1ba36bc5fe4fbe33caba49acdb166b90.webm?t=1753627110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451380/extras/1ba36bc5fe4fbe33caba49acdb166b90.mp4?t=1753627110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3451380?t=1753627110","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3451380?t=1753627110","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451380/a0e8fd3eab39e5f7eb1ae44df0a9477d7ed5de69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753627110","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451380/a0e8fd3eab39e5f7eb1ae44df0a9477d7ed5de69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753627110","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3584830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your neighbor has insulted your lawn! It's time to show him that your lawn is the best on the block!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Extremely